# Enthralling Hold's `Mode$ CantTarget | ValidTarget$ Creature.untapped |
# EffectZone$ Stack | ValidSource$ Spell.Self`: "you can't choose an untapped
# creature as this spell's target as you cast it". The spell is its own host
# while it is being cast (StaticAbilityCantTarget.java:63-68), so the only
# creature, an untapped Grizzly Bears, is no legal Enchant target and the
# Aura is not cast: it stays in hand (CR 601.2c).
startturn ai
advance 3
castspell ai 7
